    /// one poisoned row wedging the entire DA backfill with no way to give up.
    ///
    /// A sound record at ordinal X is not evidence about a poisoned row at ordinal Y. This set holds the
    /// ordinals that contradicted and have not since been resolved; the counter clears only when it empties.
